WEBVTT

00:00:07.290 --> 00:00:08.760
Beyblade...

00:00:08.760 --> 00:00:12.310
The world's most enjoyable battling top game!

00:00:12.310 --> 00:00:14.310
The beys shot from their launchers,

00:00:14.310 --> 00:00:18.360
and the Bladers' passions 
all collide in the stadium!

00:00:22.130 --> 00:00:23.810
Beyblade Burst is...

00:00:23.810 --> 00:00:28.430
...the story of the kids who do battle, 
entrusting their dreams to their Beys.

00:00:31.740 --> 00:00:35.190
I participated in the wbba. Regionals,

00:00:35.790 --> 00:00:40.610
and in the first round, I fought 
Honcho's Ragnaruk, and I won!

00:00:41.550 --> 00:00:44.650
The second round was Kensuke Midorikawa 
and his Kaiser Kerbeus.

00:00:45.090 --> 00:00:49.740
It was a really tough fight, but I managed to 
beat Kerbeus too, making it two wins in a row!

00:00:50.650 --> 00:00:54.040
And now my next opponent is Daina Kurogami.

00:00:55.360 --> 00:00:58.780
This guy's really strong too, but I still wanna win!

00:00:59.340 --> 00:01:01.440
I seriously, really wanna win!

00:01:12.360 --> 00:01:14.570
<i>Beyblade! Let's go</i>

00:01:12.360 --> 00:01:14.570
<i>Beyblade! Hajimeyou</i>

00:01:14.860 --> 00:01:20.040
<i>Become the ultimate Blader</i>

00:01:14.860 --> 00:01:20.040
<i>mezasou ze, saikyou no blader</i>

00:01:20.490 --> 00:01:25.620
<i>(Go! Burst! Go! Burst! Go! Burst! Beyblade Burst!)</i>

00:01:20.490 --> 00:01:25.620
<i>(Go! Burst! Go! Burst! Go! Burst! Beyblade Burst!)</i>

00:01:25.790 --> 00:01:30.500
<i>(Go! Burst! Go! Burst! Go! Go! Go! Burst!)</i>

00:01:25.790 --> 00:01:30.500
<i>(Go! Burst! Go! Burst! Go! Go! Go! Burst!)</i>

00:01:31.460 --> 00:01:34.760
<i>Yeah, everyone's got it</i>

00:01:31.460 --> 00:01:34.760
<i>kitto, dare datte mottenda</i>

00:01:35.260 --> 00:01:41.850
<i>The desire to win... and a Beyblade just for them!</i>

00:01:35.260 --> 00:01:41.850
<i>kachitaitte kanjou to... kimi dake no beibureedo!</i>

00:01:42.220 --> 00:01:44.770
<i>That's right, facing each other now</i>

00:01:42.220 --> 00:01:44.770
<i>sou, mukiatta hyoujou ni</i>

00:01:45.310 --> 00:01:51.900
<i>The will to become stronger starts boiling up, right?</i>

00:01:45.310 --> 00:01:51.900
<i>tsuyoku naritaitte kimochi ga hora, uzumaitendarou?</i>

00:01:52.070 --> 00:01:58.120
<i>Shoot! The throbbing of your spinning dreams (Burst!)</i>

00:01:52.070 --> 00:01:58.120
<i>SHOOT! mawari dashita yume no kodou</i>

00:01:58.160 --> 00:02:02.620
<i>Burn (Burst!) strong (Burst!), your hearts pound</i>

00:01:58.160 --> 00:02:02.620
<i>atsuku hajike, takanariau</i>

00:02:02.750 --> 00:02:04.830
<i>(3, 2, 1! Go Shoot!)</i>

00:02:02.750 --> 00:02:04.830
<i>(3, 2, 1! Go Shoot!)</i>

00:02:04.960 --> 00:02:07.540
<i>When two people (Go! Burst!)</i>

00:02:04.960 --> 00:02:07.540
<i>zettai katsundatte iu</i>

00:02:07.540 --> 00:02:09.840
<i>who've got the drive to win (Go! Burst!)</i>

00:02:07.540 --> 00:02:09.840
<i>honki no omoi doushi ga</i>

00:02:09.840 --> 00:02:11.840
<i>battle it out (Burst! Burst! Burst! Burst!)</i>

00:02:09.840 --> 00:02:11.840
<i>butsukattara</i>

00:02:12.250 --> 00:02:15.010
<i>bonds are formed (Go! Burst!)</i>

00:02:12.250 --> 00:02:15.010
<i>kizuna ga umareru no sa</i>

00:02:15.090 --> 00:02:17.680
<i>When it's time for the climax (Go! Burst!)</i>

00:02:15.090 --> 00:02:17.680
<i>ketteiteki shunkan</i>

00:02:17.800 --> 00:02:20.140
<i>face it off... together! (Go! Burst!)</i>

00:02:17.800 --> 00:02:20.140
<i>oikakeyou... issho ni!</i>

00:02:20.260 --> 00:02:25.430
<i>Can't stop, I'll finish this, with the! best! (Go!)</i>

00:02:20.260 --> 00:02:25.430
<i>mou tomaranai, kimeru no sa  sai! kyou!</i>

00:02:25.680 --> 00:02:29.150
<i>Burst Finish!</i>

00:02:25.680 --> 00:02:29.150
<i>Baasuto Finisshu o!</i>

00:02:29.610 --> 00:02:31.650
<i>(3, 2, 1! Go Shoot!)</i>

00:02:29.610 --> 00:02:31.650
<i>(3, 2, 1! Go Shoot!)</i>

00:02:34.530 --> 00:02:39.490
Beyblade Club: 
Let's Get Started!

00:02:40.180 --> 00:02:42.940
Tokonatsu, Nika, go wake your brother up!

00:02:43.640 --> 00:02:44.490
Okay!

00:02:46.160 --> 00:02:47.340
Bro's gone...

00:02:47.540 --> 00:02:49.190
Huh? Did he already leave?

00:02:49.290 --> 00:02:51.040
RUSH SHOOT!

00:02:55.440 --> 00:02:56.440
Oh!

00:03:00.150 --> 00:03:02.040
Go Shoot!

00:03:05.340 --> 00:03:08.140
Let's go. Rush Shoo-...

00:03:10.830 --> 00:03:11.470
Why!?

00:03:17.490 --> 00:03:18.970
Weird way to sleep.

00:03:18.970 --> 00:03:20.530
Bro, get up!

00:03:20.530 --> 00:03:21.970
Time to go to school!

00:03:21.970 --> 00:03:23.410
You'll be late again!

00:03:24.340 --> 00:03:25.250
Go!

00:03:29.690 --> 00:03:31.800
What're you two doing?

00:03:32.940 --> 00:03:34.240
Geez!

00:03:35.590 --> 00:03:38.290
You weren't late today, were you?

00:03:38.880 --> 00:03:41.890
Nope! I won that battle!

00:03:41.950 --> 00:03:43.830
Just... made it!

00:03:45.570 --> 00:03:47.620
I really wasn't late!

00:03:47.820 --> 00:03:51.350
Participating in Beyblade tournaments is fine,

00:03:51.350 --> 00:03:52.960
but you musn't be late.

00:03:52.960 --> 00:03:54.100
I won, though...

00:03:54.550 --> 00:03:55.700
Barely, I guess...

00:03:56.030 --> 00:03:56.770
Well?

00:03:57.230 --> 00:03:58.640
What do you want?

00:03:59.800 --> 00:04:02.610
Lemme make a Beyblade Club here at our school!

00:04:03.150 --> 00:04:05.000
Beyblade Club?

00:04:05.070 --> 00:04:09.330
There's Soccer, Volleyball, and Art Clubs, right?

00:04:09.330 --> 00:04:13.580
So, we can have a Beyblade Club just like those!

00:04:13.650 --> 00:04:14.630
I see.

00:04:15.290 --> 00:04:16.060
Principal!

00:04:16.250 --> 00:04:16.880
Please!

00:04:17.360 --> 00:04:18.670
Please let me!

00:04:19.870 --> 00:04:20.620
All right!

00:04:20.870 --> 00:04:21.790
Let's do this!

00:04:22.340 --> 00:04:25.130
Yo, join the Beyblade Club!

00:04:25.130 --> 00:04:26.630
I'm in the Baseball Club.

00:04:26.630 --> 00:04:27.640
Basketball.

00:04:27.860 --> 00:04:29.690
We're in Drama Club.

00:04:30.540 --> 00:04:33.370
Join the Beyblade Club? It'll be fun!

00:04:33.540 --> 00:04:34.290
How about it!?

00:04:34.290 --> 00:04:35.670
Sorry, can't...

00:04:36.030 --> 00:04:36.800
Wanna join!?

00:04:36.870 --> 00:04:37.920
We're busy...

00:04:37.920 --> 00:04:39.500
Come on, join!

00:04:40.040 --> 00:04:42.580
You'll obviously join, won't you, Boss?

00:04:43.190 --> 00:04:44.390
What's this about?

00:04:44.720 --> 00:04:47.120
It's the Bey Club!

00:04:47.300 --> 00:04:48.220
The heck's that?

00:04:48.850 --> 00:04:52.650
I thought of it while training at the river!

00:04:53.830 --> 00:04:56.070
Three, two, one...

00:04:56.180 --> 00:04:57.960
Go Shoot!

00:04:59.000 --> 00:05:01.360
Three, two, one...

00:05:01.370 --> 00:05:03.370
Go Shoot!

00:05:08.910 --> 00:05:10.280
That's it!

00:05:10.770 --> 00:05:12.950
Way better than practicing alone, right!?

00:05:13.140 --> 00:05:15.730
We'll be able to fight each other all the time!

00:05:15.730 --> 00:05:18.130
Was that really that hard to come up with?

00:05:18.480 --> 00:05:22.570
If the club's made we might even 
get our own club area to practice in.

00:05:23.200 --> 00:05:24.340
That's awesome!

00:05:24.340 --> 00:05:25.670
Am I right?

00:05:25.670 --> 00:05:29.000
But to make it, we need five people or more...

00:05:29.000 --> 00:05:30.250
How many we got now?

00:05:30.250 --> 00:05:31.640
Huh? One.

00:05:33.380 --> 00:05:35.500
With you, two. That's it!

00:05:35.500 --> 00:05:37.270
Just two of us?

00:05:37.570 --> 00:05:40.040
I've only just started recruiting.

00:05:40.380 --> 00:05:42.770
Oh well. Guess I'll join.

00:05:43.480 --> 00:05:44.760
Thanks, Honcho!

00:05:44.900 --> 00:05:46.980
You're a true man!

00:05:46.980 --> 00:05:49.010
Quit it, moron, you're making me blush.

00:05:51.090 --> 00:05:53.210
So, the leader's gonna be me, right?

00:05:53.950 --> 00:05:54.590
Why?

00:05:54.850 --> 00:05:56.000
Got a problem!?

00:05:56.010 --> 00:05:58.720
I do! You being the leader would be weird!

00:05:58.880 --> 00:06:00.770
Weird? You're kidding...

00:06:00.770 --> 00:06:02.740
You're the Honcho, not the leader!

00:06:03.690 --> 00:06:04.470
All right!

00:06:05.220 --> 00:06:07.140
Let's settle it with a battle.

00:06:07.660 --> 00:06:11.090
Okay! I'm always ready for a battle!

00:06:13.940 --> 00:06:18.210
Okay, this is the battle that determines 
who the leader of the Bey Club is.

00:06:18.530 --> 00:06:20.240
It's not an actual club yet, though...

00:06:21.770 --> 00:06:23.860
Enough already, let's start.

00:06:24.660 --> 00:06:27.060
Here we go. First battle!

00:06:29.810 --> 00:06:32.780
I won against him in the first 
round of the Regionals, but...

00:06:33.350 --> 00:06:34.900
After that, I've lost.

00:06:35.460 --> 00:06:39.020
I missed my Rush Shoot, and with a counter,

00:06:39.270 --> 00:06:41.190
Valkyrie burst...

00:06:41.990 --> 00:06:44.340
I won't let it happen again...

00:06:44.850 --> 00:06:45.540
Partner.

00:06:47.000 --> 00:06:48.270
Valt...

00:06:48.520 --> 00:06:52.550
Ever since our first battle, 
he's been constantly getting stronger...

00:06:52.850 --> 00:06:55.680
But so have I!

00:06:56.170 --> 00:06:57.970
Let's show 'em, Ragnaruk.

00:06:59.810 --> 00:07:02.770
Valt's a dummy, so he's gonna do a Rush Shoot.

00:07:03.350 --> 00:07:10.150
What destroyed the Defense Type Kaiser Kerbeus's 
insanely powerful defense was that high-speed first contact.

00:07:11.540 --> 00:07:13.160
But now I know it's coming.

00:07:13.620 --> 00:07:15.750
So I'll just mix it up!

00:07:16.630 --> 00:07:18.370
Ready, set!

00:07:20.290 --> 00:07:21.380
Three!

00:07:21.700 --> 00:07:22.740
Two!

00:07:22.830 --> 00:07:23.750
One!

00:07:24.310 --> 00:07:26.240
Go Shoot!

00:07:30.210 --> 00:07:32.310
Valt pulled off the Rush Shoot!

00:07:32.690 --> 00:07:34.750
Yep, just as predicted!

00:07:35.430 --> 00:07:37.760
Honcho shot Ragnaruk to the edge!

00:07:38.360 --> 00:07:40.000
And at an angle, too!

00:07:40.180 --> 00:07:42.310
He always shoots it to the center, though!

00:07:42.310 --> 00:07:43.170
Why!?

00:07:44.230 --> 00:07:48.120
Ragnaruk's circling around on the edge, 
avoiding Valkyrie's attacks!

00:07:49.540 --> 00:07:53.810
If Valkyrie can't hit its attacks, 
it's the same as having no attack power at all!

00:07:57.130 --> 00:08:01.150
Even an idiot knows that if 
you're gonna do a Rush Shoot,

00:08:02.190 --> 00:08:04.900
that they should do something to counter it!

00:08:05.420 --> 00:08:07.720
It's dodging Valkyrie's attacks!

00:08:07.720 --> 00:08:10.130
Honcho is smarter than he looks!

00:08:10.470 --> 00:08:12.450
Running away like that isn't fair!

00:08:12.910 --> 00:08:15.290
You dummy! This is a strategy!

00:08:15.430 --> 00:08:18.410
Valkyrie, don't let him go! Catch up!

00:08:18.420 --> 00:08:19.380
Not happening!

00:08:20.730 --> 00:08:22.810
Go!!

00:08:26.370 --> 00:08:27.870
Attack!

00:08:29.240 --> 00:08:30.430
It hit!

00:08:30.430 --> 00:08:32.660
Ragnaruk got pushed to the center!

00:08:32.820 --> 00:08:33.780
No way...

00:08:34.310 --> 00:08:37.000
Now it's time for the Rush Shoot!

00:08:50.800 --> 00:08:52.660
Grin and bear it, Ragnaruk!

00:09:04.320 --> 00:09:06.350
Do it!!

00:09:08.710 --> 00:09:10.620
Throw it right back at him!

00:09:16.010 --> 00:09:16.930
Yes!

00:09:17.350 --> 00:09:19.780
Valkyrie got sent flying!

00:09:19.920 --> 00:09:21.860
Ragnaruk's still in the stadium!

00:09:23.510 --> 00:09:24.090
What!?

00:09:30.260 --> 00:09:32.750
Ragnaruk bursts!

00:09:38.040 --> 00:09:39.510
It was at the same time...

00:09:39.510 --> 00:09:41.140
What's gonna happen now...?

00:09:43.490 --> 00:09:45.810
Um, this is...

00:09:46.020 --> 00:09:47.650
was nearly at the same time, so...

00:09:48.830 --> 00:09:49.830
A draw, right?

00:09:50.320 --> 00:09:51.180
Wait a sec.

00:09:53.060 --> 00:09:54.210
It wasn't at the same time.

00:09:54.800 --> 00:09:57.300
My Ragnaruk burst first.

00:09:58.620 --> 00:09:59.230
But...

00:09:59.510 --> 00:10:01.480
You guys blind or something!?

00:10:02.020 --> 00:10:05.380
The match was over as soon as my Ragnaruk burst.

00:10:06.020 --> 00:10:08.150
No matter how you look at it, Valkyrie won.

00:10:09.000 --> 00:10:10.150
Honcho...

00:10:10.790 --> 00:10:11.950
So that was it...?

00:10:12.180 --> 00:10:13.660
It was really close, though!

00:10:15.210 --> 00:10:19.450
Burst Finish! Two points to Valkyrie, so it's the winner!

00:10:20.240 --> 00:10:21.380
Yes!

00:10:23.590 --> 00:10:25.050
You're pretty strong, Valt!

00:10:25.410 --> 00:10:28.500
I lost, but I still feel good about it.

00:10:28.500 --> 00:10:29.290
Me too!

00:10:29.290 --> 00:10:29.990
Idiot.

00:10:30.230 --> 00:10:33.330
You won, so of course you feel good!

00:10:33.350 --> 00:10:34.440
Oh, right!

00:10:37.990 --> 00:10:39.780
Thank you, Valkyrie!

00:10:44.790 --> 00:10:46.860
So this means Bro's the leader, right?

00:10:46.860 --> 00:10:47.880
Looks like it!

00:10:48.050 --> 00:10:50.540
No way, I'm not the leader type.

00:10:50.700 --> 00:10:51.780
Huh!?

00:10:52.220 --> 00:10:53.310
Hey, Honcho!

00:10:53.700 --> 00:10:56.550
Let's decide on the leader 
when we get all our members.

00:10:56.950 --> 00:10:58.210
Sure, that's fine.

00:10:58.350 --> 00:10:59.830
If that's what you wanna do.

00:11:00.070 --> 00:11:01.570
Thanks, Honcho!

00:11:01.570 --> 00:11:03.570
I'm gonna go look for more members!

00:11:04.120 --> 00:11:06.910
There's one guy I have to get 
in the club no matter what!

00:11:07.500 --> 00:11:08.530
Big brother?

00:11:15.850 --> 00:11:17.410
What is he doing...?

00:11:17.750 --> 00:11:18.940
Valt Aoi...

00:11:32.780 --> 00:11:36.550
Thank you for saving me. I owe you my life.

00:11:37.150 --> 00:11:40.990
If it's for you, Princess, 
I have no qualms giving away my life.

00:11:41.080 --> 00:11:42.470
Oh, my hero!

00:11:45.910 --> 00:11:47.190
Hero, behind you!

00:11:47.190 --> 00:11:49.400
Watch out, hero! Behind you!

00:11:57.950 --> 00:11:59.380
Oh, geez.

00:12:00.950 --> 00:12:01.660
What!?

00:12:01.890 --> 00:12:04.120
A friend of Kensuke's?

00:12:04.740 --> 00:12:05.940
I'm Valt Aoi.

00:12:06.830 --> 00:12:10.190
With our kind of work, we travel around quite a bit.

00:12:10.480 --> 00:12:14.170
So Kensuke hasn't really been able to make friends.

00:12:14.170 --> 00:12:15.590
That so?

00:12:15.760 --> 00:12:16.550
Valt!

00:12:17.140 --> 00:12:19.020
Be good friends with Kensuke!

00:12:19.160 --> 00:12:20.790
Sure, leave it to me!

00:12:21.240 --> 00:12:22.170
Kensuke's mom!

00:12:23.640 --> 00:12:25.810
Thank you, hero.

00:12:36.450 --> 00:12:37.920
Not feeling good, huh?

00:12:38.510 --> 00:12:40.900
Quiet, Besu! Keep your mouth shut for a sec!

00:12:41.000 --> 00:12:42.390
Don't get so mad!

00:12:42.390 --> 00:12:44.980
I'm feeling pretty bad too here...

00:12:45.480 --> 00:12:47.540
Not feeling so hot, Kensuke?

00:12:50.930 --> 00:12:52.930
Valt Aoi!

00:12:53.860 --> 00:12:56.500
If you join our Beyblade Club, you'll feel better!

00:12:56.910 --> 00:12:57.630
Huh!?

00:12:57.630 --> 00:12:59.110
What're you talking about?

00:12:59.330 --> 00:13:02.140
Right now, the members are just me and Boss,

00:13:02.150 --> 00:13:04.390
But if you join, it's three of us!

00:13:04.720 --> 00:13:06.150
What're you trying to say!?

00:13:06.370 --> 00:13:09.620
Practicing together would be awesome, right!?

00:13:10.050 --> 00:13:11.390
No way! You're...

00:13:11.860 --> 00:13:12.960
My enemy...

00:13:12.960 --> 00:13:14.410
Yeah, yeah!

00:13:15.110 --> 00:13:16.260
We're not enemies!

00:13:16.510 --> 00:13:17.570
We're rivals!

00:13:18.220 --> 00:13:19.170
Rivals?

00:13:19.910 --> 00:13:21.760
And we're friends, too!

00:13:23.010 --> 00:13:24.100
Friends?

00:13:24.670 --> 00:13:27.220
Come on, let's practice together!

00:13:28.980 --> 00:13:30.630
I guess I'll join.

00:13:30.630 --> 00:13:31.540
Really!?

00:13:31.830 --> 00:13:33.680
But I've got one condition!

00:13:34.770 --> 00:13:35.720
What is it?

00:13:36.330 --> 00:13:38.190
Let me fight Shu Kurenai!

00:13:39.730 --> 00:13:42.170
You're friends with Shu, right?

00:13:42.400 --> 00:13:43.300
Yeah...

00:13:43.480 --> 00:13:45.590
Then let us fight Shu!

00:13:45.800 --> 00:13:48.050
Why Shu and not me!?

00:13:48.480 --> 00:13:49.410
But...

00:13:49.700 --> 00:13:53.250
We already lost to you, so we can't 
fight Shu in the tournament...

00:13:54.000 --> 00:13:56.450
So we wanna fight him now!

00:13:59.570 --> 00:14:00.540
All right then.

00:14:02.350 --> 00:14:04.110
Come on, Shu!

00:14:04.110 --> 00:14:06.340
Battle with Kensuke!

00:14:06.890 --> 00:14:08.040
I'm practicing.

00:14:10.210 --> 00:14:12.820
Then it'll be even better practice!

00:14:12.820 --> 00:14:15.880
Kensuke's Kerbeus is crazy strong!

00:14:15.880 --> 00:14:18.710
And he said he wanted to fight you!

00:14:18.710 --> 00:14:22.940
When he told me, I kinda got 
sidetracked from the club...

00:14:23.300 --> 00:14:23.990
Valt?

00:14:24.440 --> 00:14:28.520
And I also had crazy fun battling Kensuke!

00:14:28.520 --> 00:14:30.320
C'mon, Shu...!

00:14:30.430 --> 00:14:31.230
Okay.

00:14:34.280 --> 00:14:35.170
Let's battle.

00:14:35.660 --> 00:14:37.160
I knew it!

00:14:37.160 --> 00:14:40.150
Kensuke! Shu said he'd fight you!

00:14:46.540 --> 00:14:47.750
Shu Kurenai.

00:14:48.360 --> 00:14:50.660
I'm Kensuke Midorikawa.

00:14:51.230 --> 00:14:52.090
I know.

00:14:52.900 --> 00:14:54.640
I saw your battle with Valt.

00:14:55.430 --> 00:14:57.200
You remembered me!?

00:14:57.380 --> 00:14:58.820
Yeah, of course.

00:15:00.370 --> 00:15:03.000
I've always wanted to fight you!

00:15:03.300 --> 00:15:06.230
It's been my dream to fight you in the finals...

00:15:07.860 --> 00:15:08.680
I'm flattered.

00:15:11.110 --> 00:15:13.410
All right, let's start!

00:15:14.330 --> 00:15:15.790
First battle!

00:15:20.390 --> 00:15:24.990
Kaiser Kerbeus has a heavyweight 
defensive shaft on it's Press Driver.

00:15:25.220 --> 00:15:26.110
A Defense Type.

00:15:28.060 --> 00:15:29.490
Storm Spriggan.

00:15:29.890 --> 00:15:31.580
Attack and Defense...

00:15:31.580 --> 00:15:34.610
Equal amounts of both of them, a Balance Type.

00:15:35.090 --> 00:15:39.550
With a frontal attack, 
this'll turn into a battle of Defense.

00:15:40.180 --> 00:15:41.870
Will he attack!?

00:15:41.870 --> 00:15:43.270
Will he defend!?

00:15:43.580 --> 00:15:44.310
Which is it!?

00:15:44.880 --> 00:15:46.790
Ready, set!

00:15:47.030 --> 00:15:47.840
Three!

00:15:48.340 --> 00:15:49.110
Two!

00:15:49.620 --> 00:15:50.330
One!

00:15:50.930 --> 00:15:52.850
Go Shoot!

00:15:59.330 --> 00:16:00.940
So he's playing passively?

00:16:01.940 --> 00:16:03.630
As I thought, you put up your guard.

00:16:04.000 --> 00:16:06.920
If it's a battle of Defense, Kerbeus won't lose!

00:16:07.280 --> 00:16:08.840
I'm not gonna play passively!

00:16:09.000 --> 00:16:10.630
Go, Spriggan!

00:16:14.060 --> 00:16:16.100
Spriggan's attacking!

00:16:16.880 --> 00:16:19.100
Guard it, Kaiser Kerbeus!

00:16:21.030 --> 00:16:23.050
Beat him down, Spriggan!

00:16:23.400 --> 00:16:26.400
Bite into the stadium with your Press Driver!

00:16:31.410 --> 00:16:33.570
Spriggan and Kerbeus...

00:16:33.570 --> 00:16:35.570
They're both awesome!

00:16:36.030 --> 00:16:38.300
Spriggan, hit him!

00:16:42.690 --> 00:16:43.640
It got pushed!

00:16:44.340 --> 00:16:47.460
Yes! The longer the battle, 
the better Kerbeus'll do!

00:16:47.730 --> 00:16:48.890
I wonder about that.

00:16:52.690 --> 00:16:54.880
Kerbeus's spin is slowing down!

00:16:54.920 --> 00:16:56.280
No way!

00:16:56.820 --> 00:16:59.140
Spriggan can survive in long fights as well.

00:16:59.520 --> 00:17:01.200
That's a Balance Type!

00:17:06.270 --> 00:17:07.530
Spin Finish!

00:17:07.950 --> 00:17:09.930
Storm Spriggan wins!

00:17:12.260 --> 00:17:13.550
Shu, one point!

00:17:14.410 --> 00:17:15.810
That was close, Kensuke.

00:17:16.230 --> 00:17:18.850
Just a little longer and you would've won.

00:17:18.850 --> 00:17:20.610
I don't need your pity!

00:17:21.730 --> 00:17:23.810
We've still got a second battle!

00:17:24.360 --> 00:17:27.000
Yeah! Okay, let's do the second battle!

00:17:27.220 --> 00:17:30.450
We'll win this time for sure!

00:17:30.810 --> 00:17:32.780
If you get this heated up...

00:17:33.010 --> 00:17:34.050
You can't beat me.

00:17:34.050 --> 00:17:34.970
What!?

00:17:38.080 --> 00:17:39.180
Second battle!

00:17:42.510 --> 00:17:46.290
Attack? Defense? Which one...?

00:17:47.440 --> 00:17:49.630
Last battle, he broke through my defenses...

00:17:49.820 --> 00:17:51.270
So what do I do now...?

00:17:52.410 --> 00:17:55.070
After barely losing the first battle

00:17:55.070 --> 00:17:56.170
he's getting nervous.

00:17:56.710 --> 00:18:00.230
That nervousness is what's 
going to make you lose this battle.

00:18:00.680 --> 00:18:02.610
As long as he doesn't realize it...

00:18:03.250 --> 00:18:04.870
Ready, set!

00:18:05.410 --> 00:18:06.210
Three!

00:18:06.560 --> 00:18:07.500
Two!

00:18:07.860 --> 00:18:08.720
One!

00:18:09.550 --> 00:18:11.580
Go Shoot!

00:18:16.830 --> 00:18:19.080
Woah! Kerbeus is attacking!

00:18:19.340 --> 00:18:20.810
Attack right from the start!

00:18:20.810 --> 00:18:22.380
Attack,

00:18:22.380 --> 00:18:25.090
Kaiser Kerbeus!

00:18:34.830 --> 00:18:37.460
Brace yourself, Storm Spriggan!

00:18:50.230 --> 00:18:51.060
Yes!

00:18:53.650 --> 00:18:54.800
It stopped!

00:18:55.040 --> 00:18:58.450
This is the power of Spriggan's Unite Driver!

00:18:58.630 --> 00:18:59.650
Go!

00:18:59.760 --> 00:19:01.520
Counter Break!

00:19:08.260 --> 00:19:09.760
Burst!

00:19:22.870 --> 00:19:25.100
Shu wins with a Burst Finish!

00:19:26.390 --> 00:19:28.240
Counter Break...

00:19:28.800 --> 00:19:32.110
Shu Kurenai... he really is strong!

00:19:34.210 --> 00:19:35.430
That was a good battle.

00:19:36.040 --> 00:19:38.110
D-Don't try and act cool!

00:19:38.480 --> 00:19:41.810
The next time we fight, I'll win no matter what!

00:19:41.810 --> 00:19:42.530
Could you...

00:19:42.830 --> 00:19:44.530
let us fight again some time...?

00:19:46.730 --> 00:19:48.440
Which one of them is the real you?

00:19:49.860 --> 00:19:51.730
They're both Kensuke!

00:19:51.900 --> 00:19:52.920
Shut up!

00:19:52.920 --> 00:19:54.920
Could you be quiet?

00:19:59.280 --> 00:20:00.770
Hey, Kensuke!

00:20:00.770 --> 00:20:02.460
You're joining the Bey Club, right!?

00:20:04.710 --> 00:20:06.290
No way...

00:20:06.310 --> 00:20:08.770
He said he'd join...

00:20:08.980 --> 00:20:09.690
Shu!

00:20:10.020 --> 00:20:11.860
You'll join of course!

00:20:12.160 --> 00:20:14.000
Our Beyblade Club!

00:20:14.260 --> 00:20:15.980
I don't like groups.

00:20:18.200 --> 00:20:20.130
So you're on your own there.

00:20:20.710 --> 00:20:22.010
Whaaat!?

00:20:22.390 --> 00:20:26.730
What the heck, Shu! Just join the Bey Club!

00:20:25.060 --> 00:20:26.610
--Counter Break, huh?

00:20:27.760 --> 00:20:30.040
Even more reason to get excited about it.

00:20:30.320 --> 00:20:32.740
My battle with Shu Kurenai...

00:20:35.000 --> 00:20:37.380
One sec, be there in a bit!

00:20:38.500 --> 00:20:41.050
Yes, who is it?

00:20:41.050 --> 00:20:42.140
It's Besu!

00:20:42.270 --> 00:20:42.940
Kerrrru...

00:20:45.280 --> 00:20:46.270
Mom, what happened!?

00:20:46.930 --> 00:20:50.040
S-Something weird, outside!

00:20:52.210 --> 00:20:55.020
Oh, so you're Valt's friend.

00:20:55.020 --> 00:20:56.560
His name's Kensuke!

00:20:56.910 --> 00:20:58.090
Hello!

00:20:58.640 --> 00:20:59.940
Hello!

00:20:59.940 --> 00:21:01.750
Ah, should I take you upstairs?

00:21:01.750 --> 00:21:02.810
Here's fine!

00:21:02.810 --> 00:21:03.960
What're you doing here?

00:21:04.130 --> 00:21:06.870
Did you come here to get 
revenge for losing to Valt?

00:21:07.170 --> 00:21:08.340
That's not it!

00:21:09.290 --> 00:21:11.060
I'll join the Bey Club.

00:21:12.080 --> 00:21:12.820
Bye then.

00:21:13.380 --> 00:21:14.870
Wait, Kensuke!

00:21:16.160 --> 00:21:17.380
What're you doing!?

00:21:17.380 --> 00:21:20.310
You came all the way here, 
so make yourself at home!

00:21:20.320 --> 00:21:22.020
Yeah, make yourself at home!

00:21:22.310 --> 00:21:24.500
No, no, I'm leaving!

00:21:24.610 --> 00:21:26.480
Come on, come on!

00:21:25.940 --> 00:21:27.520
Let go, I'm leaving!

00:21:26.610 --> 00:21:27.510
We can hang out and--

00:21:27.510 --> 00:21:30.440
You'll eat my bread and you'll like it!

00:21:31.610 --> 00:21:32.950
O-Okay!

00:21:33.160 --> 00:21:34.530
Thanks for the food.

00:21:35.340 --> 00:21:36.450
Very good.

00:21:37.700 --> 00:21:40.360
My mom's bread is delicious!

00:22:00.690 --> 00:22:03.990
Just two more until the Bey Club is a reality!

00:22:18.720 --> 00:22:25.070
<i>With huge hopes stuffed in my bag</i>

00:22:18.720 --> 00:22:25.070
<i>ookina kibou wo baggu ni tsumekonde</i>

00:22:25.200 --> 00:22:31.560
<i>The train set off towards the future</i>

00:22:25.200 --> 00:22:31.560
<i>ressha wa mirai e ima hashiri dashita</i>

00:22:31.740 --> 00:22:37.160
<i>Holding the ticket to my dreams close</i>

00:22:31.740 --> 00:22:37.160
<i>yume no kippu wo gyutto nigirishimete</i>

00:22:37.600 --> 00:22:46.320
<i>I move forward, without a doubt in my mind</i>

00:22:37.600 --> 00:22:46.320
<i>osorezu ni susumu mou keshite mayowanai kara</i>

00:22:47.600 --> 00:22:50.760
<i>On these long and winding rails</i>

00:22:47.600 --> 00:22:50.760
<i>hatenaku tsuzuku nagai reeru</i>

00:22:50.800 --> 00:22:53.920
<i>Where you get off is up to you</i>

00:22:50.800 --> 00:22:53.920
<i>shuuchakuten wa jibun de kimeru</i>

00:22:54.000 --> 00:22:56.230
<i>Chase it, chase it</i>

00:22:54.000 --> 00:22:56.230
<i>oikakete oikakete</i>

00:22:56.270 --> 00:23:00.490
<i>I know your dreams will come true some day</i>

00:22:56.270 --> 00:23:00.490
<i>mieru keshiki ga aru to boku wa shinjiteru</i>

00:23:00.630 --> 00:23:06.230
<i>Run, keep running, run far</i>

00:23:00.630 --> 00:23:06.230
<i>hashitte hashiri tsuzukete, kakenukeru</i>

00:23:06.400 --> 00:23:10.360
<i>Get past the countless tears</i>

00:23:06.400 --> 00:23:10.360
<i>ikutsumo no namida o koete</i>

00:23:10.450 --> 00:23:13.340
<i>so we can be stronger</i>

00:23:10.450 --> 00:23:13.340
<i>bokura wa tsuyoku naru</i>

00:23:13.520 --> 00:23:19.070
<i>Some day we'll get glory, so until then</i>

00:23:13.520 --> 00:23:19.070
<i>itsuka eikou o tsukamu sono hi made</i>

00:23:19.250 --> 00:23:22.630
<i>Turn your dreams into reality</i>

00:23:19.250 --> 00:23:22.630
<i>yume wa yume no mama janai</i>

00:23:22.890 --> 00:23:26.980
<i>Our endless adventure continues</i>

00:23:22.890 --> 00:23:26.980
<i>owarinai tabi wa tsuzuku</i>

00:23:36.130 --> 00:23:38.870
My third round opponent is Daina Kurogami!

00:23:39.180 --> 00:23:41.080
He bugs the crap out of me!

00:23:41.340 --> 00:23:44.140
I'm gonna have to train hard to beat him!

00:23:44.330 --> 00:23:47.050
Until I perfect the Rush Shoot,

00:23:47.080 --> 00:23:50.060
I've gotta train, train, and train some more!

00:23:50.500 --> 00:23:54.920
Next time on Beyblade Burst: 
"The Grim Reaper Descends! The Jet-Black Deathscyther!!:

00:23:55.440 --> 00:23:57.380
Three, two, one...

00:23:57.710 --> 00:23:59.270
Go Shoot!
